    {
      "mentions": [],
      "time": 1784811755.5928311,
      "id": "90d57c3a-3f6a-4106-b432-9acf55e97dc0",
      "body": "```python\ncols_with_null = df.columns[df.isnull().any()]\n\nfor col in cols_with_null:\n    print(f\"--- {col} ---\")\n    print(f\"Median: {df[col].median()}\")\n    print(f\"25th percentile: {df[col].quantile(0.25)}\")\n    print(f\"75th percentile: {df[col].quantile(0.75)}\")\n    print(f\"IQR: {df[col].quantile(0.75) - df[col].quantile(0.25)}\")\n    print(f\"Outliers: {((df[col] < df[col].quantile(0.25) - 1.5*(df[col].quantile(0.75)-df[col].quantile(0.25))) | (df[col] > df[col].quantile(0.75) + 1.5*(df[col].quantile(0.75)-df[col].quantile(0.25)))).sum()}\")\n    print()\n```\n\nThis gives you median, Q1, Q3, IQR, and outlier count for each column with nulls\u2014without plotting anything.",
      "type": "msg",
      "raw_time": false,
      "sender": "jupyter-ai-personas::jupyter_ai_acp_client::OpenCodeAcpPersona"
    },
