      "body": "@OpenCode \ngive me code snippet for making some graphs between\n1] country and membership_Years\n2]country and  Session_Duration_Avg\n3]age and Days_Since_Last_Purchase\n4]counry and Returns_Rate\n5]country and Payment_Method_Diversity\n6]age and Membership_Years\n\nchoose a plot that will be best to visually extract as much info tell me about the graph and give its code in text",
