      "id": "d33f2f27-c171-4287-80e0-08bdbe4bbbdf",
      "mentions": [],
      "time": 1784893293.405415,
      "body": "## Best Plot Choices & Code Snippets\n\n**1. Country vs Membership_Years**\n- **Plot:** Box Plot - shows distribution spread and outliers per country\n```python\nplt.figure(figsize=(12, 5))\nsns.boxplot(x='Country', y='Membership_Years', data=df)\nplt.title('Membership Years by Country')\nplt.xticks(rotation=45)\nplt.show()\n```\n\n**2. Country vs Session_Duration_Avg**\n- **Plot:** Violin Plot - shows distribution density + median\n```python\nplt.figure(figsize=(12, 5))\nsns.violinplot(x='Country', y='Session_Duration_Avg', data=df)\nplt.title('Session Duration by Country')\nplt.xticks(rotation=45)\nplt.show()\n```\n\n**3. Age vs Days_Since_Last_Purchase**\n- **Plot:** Scatter Plot with hue - shows relationship + pattern\n```python\nplt.figure(figsize=(10, 5))\nsns.scatterplot(x='Age', y='Days_Since_Last_Purchase', data=df, alpha=0.5)\nplt.title('Age vs Days Since Last Purchase')\nplt.show()\n```\n\n**4. Country vs Returns_Rate**\n- **Plot:** Box Plot - shows return rate distribution per country\n```python\nplt.figure(figsize=(12, 5))\nsns.boxplot(x='Country', y='Returns_Rate', data=df)\nplt.title('Returns Rate by Country')\nplt.xticks(rotation=45)\nplt.show()\n```\n\n**5. Country vs Payment_Method_Diversity**\n- **Plot:** Bar Plot (mean) - shows average payment diversity per country\n```python\nplt.figure(figsize=(12, 5))\nsns.barplot(x='Country', y='Payment_Method_Diversity', data=df, estimator=np.mean)\nplt.title('Avg Payment Method Diversity by Country')\nplt.xticks(rotation=45)\nplt.show()\n```\n\n**6. Age vs Membership_Years**\n- **Plot:** Hexbin Plot - shows density for two continuous variables\n```python\nplt.figure(figsize=(10, 5))\nplt.hexbin(df['Age'], df['Membership_Years'], gridsize=20, cmap='Blues')\nplt.colorbar(label='Count')\nplt.xlabel('Age')\nplt.ylabel('Membership Years')\nplt.title('Age vs Membership Years (Density)')\nplt.show()\n```"
    },
