"The {param_name!r} parameter of {caller_name} must be\"\n    100     f\" {constraints_str}. Got {param_val!r} instead.\"\n    101 )\n\nInvalidParameterError: The 'scoring' parameter of GridSearchCV must be a str among {'neg_negative_likelihood_ratio', 'v_measure_score', 'precision_samples', 'jaccard_weighted', 'roc_auc_ovo', 'f1_weighted', 'neg_root_mean_squared_error', 'neg_median_absolute_error', 'jaccard_micro', 'f1_macro', 'jaccard', 'explained_variance', 'balanced_accuracy', 'f1_micro', 'rand_score', 'homogeneity_score', 'adjusted_mutual_info_score', 'recall', 'roc_auc', 'roc_auc_ovr', 'fowlkes_mallows_score', 'neg_log_loss', 'f1', 'neg_root_mean_squared_log_error', 'accuracy', 'mutual_info_score', 'precision_macro', 'recall_micro', 'recall_weighted', 'matthews_corrcoef', 'roc_auc_ovr_weighted', 'positive_likelihood_ratio', 'neg_mean_squared_log_error', 'neg_mean_squared_error', 'normalized_mutual_info_score', 'precision', 'r2', 'recall_macro', 'top_k_accuracy', 'neg_max_error', 'jaccard_samples', 'precision_weighted', 'average_precision', 'neg_mean_absolute_error', 'roc_auc_ovo_weighted', 'f1_samples', 'neg_mean_absolute_percentage_error', 'precision_micro', 'neg_mean_poisson_deviance', 'adjusted_rand_score', 'jaccard_macro', 'neg_brier_score', 'neg_mean_gamma_deviance', 'recall_samples', 'd2_absolute_error_score', 'completeness_score'}, a callable, an instance of 'list', an instance of 'tuple', an instance of 'dict' or None. Got 'roc-auc' instead.",
